      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Police Department, the Fire Department, and the Emergency Medical Service (the \"Emergency Response Agencies\") maintain computerized databases of addresses and other locations within the City of New York for purposes of enabling such agencies to respond to emergencies that occur within the City of New York; and",
